message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "TAM__long_acc_control"
type: software
abstract: >-
  This package provides a longitudinal controller for a combustion engine vehicle
  consisting of multiple feedforward and feedback parts. It takes a longitudinal
  acceleration as input and outputs wheel-individual brake pressures, a throttle
  and a gear command.
